icated across\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:49:#   partition: exactly one full row and one full column of divider color, forming a cross\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:149:    assert len(legend_sides) == 1, \"legend groups must occupy exactly one side of the cross\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:200:        assert pr != div_r and pc != div_c, \"sprite must not lie on the divider cross\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:316:def _cross_layout(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:540:    # Generation only needs one guaranteed match per local legend entry plus one cross-region distractor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:572:    uniques = {region: next(iter(local_holes[region] - set.intersection(*local_holes.values()))) for region in region_keys}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D9/2/code.py:603:    rects, region_to_legend_rect, legends_by_rect, _arrangement = _cross_layout(grid)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/332f06d7/D6/1/code.py:32:#      reachable/stuck samples across calls instead of leaving the split fully random.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b3084d4/D7/1/code.py:273:    if FEATURE == \"cross5\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b3084d4/D7/1/code.py:413:    if FEATURE == \"cross5\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:3:# Change: 交叉标记（crossing markers）——垂直管道通过水平管道的交叉处，用一对5号像素标记穿行管道的交叉点前后，表... → 单侧标记转向\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:13:#   The original crossing row had symmetric color-5 cells bracketing a vertical\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:15:#   variant, each swap row is still a horizontal color-8 segment crossing several\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:19:#   horizontal arm\". Unmarked intersections stay straight.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:26:#   The rule has e