ence. The variant breaks this assumption, so the solver must switch to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:370:def _cross_span(legends: list[dict], arrangement: str) -> int:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:423:    cross = _cross_span(legends, \"horizontal\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:424:    panel_h = cross + PANEL_PADDING + random.randint(0, PANEL_EXTRA_THICKNESS)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:431:        r0 = _rand_between(1, panel_h - cross - 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:436:        r0 = _rand_between(div_r + 2, GRID_SIZE - cross - 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:444:    cross = _cross_span(legends, \"vertical\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:445:    panel_w = cross + PANEL_PADDING + random.randint(0, PANEL_EXTRA_THICKNESS)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:452:        c0 = _rand_between(1, panel_w - cross - 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:457:        c0 = _rand_between(div_c + 2, GRID_SIZE - cross - 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:466:    cross_dim: int,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:472:        r_min, r_max = 1, panel_h - cross_dim - 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:476:        r_min, r_max = 1, panel_h - cross_dim - 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:480:        r_min, r_max = dr + 2, n - 1 - cross_dim\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:484:        r_min, r_max = dr + 2, n - 1 - cross_dim\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:493:    cross = _cross_span(legends, arrangement)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:495:    cross_panel = cross + PANEL_PADDING + random.randint(0, PANEL_EXTRA_THICKNESS)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/0/code.py:497:    