s (slot_wire, bypass_wire) after all crossovers.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/2/code.py:512:    for xover_idx, (src_slot, dst_slot) in enumerate(crossovers):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/2/code.py:635:    crossovers = _decompose_to_crossovers(perm)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/2/code.py:636:    n_xovers = len(crossovers)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/2/code.py:660:    slot_wire, bypass_wire = _build_wire_network(grid, n, ch_cols, bypass_col, top_ep_row, bot_ep_row, crossovers, xover_rows)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b5ca7ac4/D15/2/code.py:23:#     - a row-line overwrites one row of every square it crosses\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b5ca7ac4/D15/2/code.py:24:#     - a col-line overwrites one column of every square it crosses\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D10/3/code.py:20:#       arrows geometrically crosses on a background cell.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D10/3/code.py:46:#       notice \"crossing rays produce 9\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D10/3/code.py:49:#       than collapsing into a pure line-crossing puzzle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D10/3/code.py:63:#       whose only shared cell is a chosen crossing point.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D10/3/code.py:72:#         1. a visible diagonal crossing that turns into color 9\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D7/3/code.py:60:#   - Output-time ray occupancy is also kept disjoint, except for the intentional \"later ray crosses former wall cell\" event.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6e453dd6/D5/2/code.py:15:#      reaches `sep-2`. This makes the D5 change observable within one example instead of relying on cross-example luck.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6e453dd6/D5/2/code.py:133:    - Ignore 1-cell holes; only enclosed trigger-side holes with area at least 2 paint red rays across the corresponding rows on the right pane.\n/hom